[tr][td]Base58Check encode ([tt]Base58CheckEncode[/tt])[/td][td]47.7 ns/B[/td][td]6.1 ns/B[/td][td][b]7.9x faster[/b][/td][td]64-bit limbs divided by 58^10; was 3.2x slower on 09-27[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]MuHash insert of one coin ([tt]MuHash[/tt])[/td][td]2.66 us[/td][td]0.45 us[/td][td][b]6.0x faster[/b][/td][td]expand + one multiply; Core's op is expand + two multiplies[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]MuHash 3072-bit multiply ([tt]MuHashMul[/tt], per multiply)[/td][td]1.16 us[/td][td]0.29 us[/td][td][b]4.0x faster[/b][/td][td]AVX-512 IFMA / ADX paths; Core's [tt]*=[/tt] is two multiplies, so the row is per multiply[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]block archive: raw read ([tt]ReadRawBlockBench[/tt])[/td][td]37.4 us[/td][td]13.3 us[/td][td][b]2.8x faster[/b][/td][td]raw bytes on both sides[/td][/tr]
